OpenQuantum Hamiltonian simulation

The Suzuki recursion and qDrift sampling formula in mcp/bridge.py are adapted
from the MIT-licensed UnitaryLab Algorithms source identified in source.json.
The upstream copyright and full MIT permission notice are preserved in LICENSE (trailing whitespace normalized).
OpenQuantum modifications (2026): Qiskit circuit construction; explicit Pauli
input, exact caller-selected steps, deterministic local random seed, identity
phase handling, no file outputs, optional simulation and independent reference.
No UnitaryLab simulator, Agent, or unitarylab-algorithms package is included.
Qiskit is Apache-2.0; NumPy and SciPy are BSD-3-Clause dependencies.
